{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:48 2026-08-06 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今(6 日)下午2時41分，海事處職員報案指，一名男子在蒲台島一艘貨船上跳下，在海中載浮載沉，男子稍後被水警救起，清醒被送往瑪麗醫院治理。警方正調查事件。</p>\n<img alt=\"獲救男子清醒送院。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9f64fe08c095b4eb0f0d5a1b030a9046/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_16_39_07_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0503a98c0c725fa3062e2a275c07cac6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_16_39_07.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水警在場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/90a3ebbc2680031aea053480d6b8daf4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_16_39_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b72317faf53d2348be2462c52f9873c8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_16_37_32_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/836dfcf08ff091fa383756697e7adb64/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_16_37_32_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c84222f48debf4335ee643deb012f87a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_16_37_32.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/63be681e857b162c9b0af7332c6fc1b2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_16_37_31.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T09:00:04.681634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}